          Mac Address Table
-------------------------------------------
Vlan    Mac Address       Type        Ports
----    -----------       --------    -----
  10    0000.1111.2222    DYNAMIC     Gi0/1
  10    0000.3333.4444    DYNAMIC     Gi0/2
  20    0000.5555.6666    DYNAMIC     Gi0/3$$::text, $$[{"id": "A", "text": "Gi0/2", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "B", "text": "Gi0/1", "is_correct": true}, {"id": "C", "text": "Gi0/3", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "D", "text": "All ports in VLAN 10", "is_correct": false}]$$::jsonb, $$The MAC table maps 0000.1111.2222 in VLAN 10 to port Gi0/1.$$::text, $${"https://learningcontent.cisco.com/documents/marketing/exam-topics/200-301-CCNA-v1.1.pdf"}$$::text[], $$2.0 Network Access$$::text, 20.0, '0669844885a1bd50', true) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
