Capability codes: (R) Router, (B) Bridge, (T) Telephone, (C) DOCSIS Cable Device
Device ID        Local Intf     Hold-time  Capability      Port ID
Router1          Gi0/1          120        R               Gi0/0
Switch2          Gi0/2          120        B               Gi0/1$$::text, $$[{"id": "A", "text": "Bridge", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "B", "text": "Router", "is_correct": true}, {"id": "C", "text": "Telephone", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "D", "text": "Cable device", "is_correct": false}]$$::jsonb, $$Capability 'R' indicates a Router connected to Gi0/1.$$::text, $${"https://learningcontent.cisco.com/documents/marketing/exam-topics/200-301-CCNA-v1.1.pdf"}$$::text[], $$2.0 Network Access$$::text, 20.0, 'd1aa1de32084bad8', true) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
