Interface    PID   Area            IP Address/Mask    Cost  State Nbrs F/C
Gi0/0        1     0               10.1.1.1/24        1     DR    2/2
Gi0/1        1     0               10.1.2.1/24        1     BDR   1/1
Se0/0/0      1     0               10.1.3.1/30        64    P2P   0/0$$::text, $$[{"id": "A", "text": "Gi0/1", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "B", "text": "Gi0/0", "is_correct": true}, {"id": "C", "text": "Se0/0/0", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "D", "text": "None", "is_correct": false}]$$::jsonb, $$The State column for Gi0/0 shows DR, Designated Router.$$::text, $${"https://learningcontent.cisco.com/documents/marketing/exam-topics/200-301-CCNA-v1.1.pdf"}$$::text[], $$3.0 IP Connectivity$$::text, 25.0, '8153468912602d5e', true) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
