        via 192.168.1.2 (28160/2816), Gi0/0$$::text, $$[{"id": "A", "text": "2816", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "B", "text": "28160", "is_correct": true}, {"id": "C", "text": "192.168.1.2", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "D", "text": "Gi0/0", "is_correct": false}]$$::jsonb, $$The FD is 28160; 2816 is the reported distance from the neighbor.$$::text, $${"https://learningcontent.cisco.com/documents/marketing/exam-topics/200-301-CCNA-v1.1.pdf"}$$::text[], $$3.0 IP Connectivity$$::text, 25.0, '256d616cdb54f265', true) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
